---
/** App Store privacy policy URL (docs/app-store/listing.md "URLs"). */
import InfoPage from '../components/InfoPage.astro';
import { SUPPORT_EMAIL, INFO_UPDATED } from '../lib/support';
---
<InfoPage
  title={{ en: 'Atlas privacy policy', zh: 'Atlas 隐私政策' }}
  email={SUPPORT_EMAIL}
  updated={INFO_UPDATED}
  body={[
    {
      en: 'Atlas does not collect, store on any server, share or sell any personal data.',
      zh: 'Atlas 不收集、不在任何服务器上存储、不共享也不出售任何个人数据。',
    },
    {
      en: "The iPad app has no accounts, advertising, analytics or tracking. When you turn on Voice in Present mode, it downloads that topic's recorded narration (plain audio files, with no account, cookie or identifier attached) from atlas.gavin.pub and keeps it on your iPad; like the website, the host (Cloudflare) processes technical request data such as IP addresses in order to deliver them. Everything else works offline, and without a connection read-aloud uses the speech voice built into your iPad. Your language, theme and display preferences are saved only on your device and are removed when you delete the app.",
      zh: 'iPad App 没有账号、广告、统计或追踪。在演示模式打开“语音”时，App 会从 atlas.gavin.pub 下载这个主题的讲解录音（只是普通的音频文件，不附带账号、Cookie 或任何标识），保存在 iPad 上；与网站一样，托管方 Cloudflare 为传送这些文件会处理 IP 地址等技术性请求数据。其余内容都可离线使用，没有网络时用 iPad 自带的语音朗读。语言、外观和显示偏好只保存在你的设备上，删除 App 后即被移除。',
    },
    {
      en: 'The website atlas.gavin.pub uses no analytics or cookies. Like any website, its host (Cloudflare) processes technical request data such as IP addresses in order to deliver the pages.',
      zh: '网站 atlas.gavin.pub 不使用统计工具或 Cookie。与所有网站一样，托管方 Cloudflare 为传送网页会处理 IP 地址等技术性请求数据。',
    },
  ]}
/>
